  {
   "id": "schlag-den-star-das-3-spiel-256216@major-2023-10-19",
   "gameId": "schlag-den-star-das-3-spiel-256216",
   "displayName": "The next Schlag den Star update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-10-19T12:50:01.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear Schlag den Star fans,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "except for a small update on the general multiplayer availability, there have been no further patches yet. The most important thing first: The team is working on a new patch at full capacity.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "At this point we would like to give a little insight into the current situation and processes. Currently, the team is working on making a shared version available for all platforms. Schlag den Star - Das 3. Spiel is the first part, which has a real online multiplayer. Besides the basic idea of online multiplayer, we wanted to make it cross-platform as well, so that you can play against your friends on any platform. We, and especially the team, have entered new technical territory. We knew that there would be many challenges that were unknown to us, but we were not prepared for the extent of the problems. It's nothing the team can't handle, but unfortunately it's taking much longer than expected.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Since we currently have to implement some cross-platform requirements from Sony, the PlayStation and Xbox versions have unfortunately been delayed and this has thrown our patching schedule into quite a mess. The team has had to make various changes to the technical base for multiplayer, which has taken time and created new issues. Currently we are in a loop of testing and fixing bugs. As soon as everything is stable, we will release an update immediately. This first patch will mainly update the technical foundation and make it possible for all current and upcoming platforms to work together. We hope to make this live on Friday (20.10.). After that, we will finally be able to take care of polishing, especially fixing bugs in the rendering and voice output.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We thank you for your patience and hope that you have a lot of fun with Schlag den Star. Soon you will not only be able to compete against your friends on the PC, but also on all consoles.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
